      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "传说诞生的瞬间可遇不可求。\n能有机会亲眼见证那瞬间的人也相当有限。",
      "source_fingerprint": "426a4712ab0c919156bbc23fdd1d967363d3481643aa10f6837c7c6721894746",
